-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §55: the work week the agreement sets, and
-- the pay for it, are the whole answer to the teaching employee's various
-- tasks, save tasks whose pay was settled separately.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: declares the week
-- and its pay the answer to the parties' claims: a clause of settlement,
-- which sets no hour.

§ `55`

-- ¶1: the structure of the work week the agreement sets (part ג, part ז)
-- and the pay for it answer all the teaching employee's tasks; a task is
-- paid beyond them only where its pay was settled separately.
@ref akn:art_55/p1
GIVEN `its pay was settled separately` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a task is paid beyond the Oz week under section 55` `its pay was settled separately` IF
    `its pay was settled separately`

#ASSERT NOT `a task is paid beyond the Oz week under section 55` FALSE
#ASSERT `a task is paid beyond the Oz week under section 55` TRUE
